// A severe_path_only analyzer runs when the alert's severity (as sent to
// TheHive, 1-4) is at least severe_path.min_severity, or when an earlier
// analyzer for the same observable returned one of severe_path.prior_verdicts.
// Then the budget: no job starts once budget_s have passed since the
// enrichment started (a job in flight is never cut).
